WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.375
A label links to its box by id, and a form does nothing alone

2
00:00:05.301 --> 00:00:08.226
A &lt;form&gt; holds the boxes people type in.

3
00:00:08.852 --> 00:00:12.552
A p tag puts the label and its box on their own line.

4
00:00:13.278 --> 00:00:17.203
The label's for matches the box's I D. That joins them.

5
00:00:18.054 --> 00:00:20.529
A &lt;button&gt; is for sending the answers.

6
00:00:23.039 --> 00:00:27.189
But nothing is connected to it. Code behind a form does the work.
